tacks by the army killed some of its fighters and destroyed its command centres.\nSeparately, the human rights group Emergency Lawyers said in a post on X that a market was hit on Friday in Nyala and the drone used was “affiliated” with the Sudanese army.\nReporting from the Sudanese capital, Khartoum, Al Jazeera’s Almigdad Alruhaid said on Saturday that the fighting between the army and RSF has “intensified”.\n“In South Kordofan, a source in the Sudanese government told Al Jazeera that the RSF carried out drone attacks on mining sites with the exchange in fire intensifying in many parts of Sudan in the past 24 hours.”\nin western Sudan with drones to try to retake territory controlled by the RSF, which holds most of the area.\nThis month, Sudanese military chief Abdel Fattah al-Burhan promised to seize “every inch” of territory under RSF control.\nThe Sudanese civil war began in 2023 and has killed tens of thousands of people. The United Nations has described the situation in Sudan as the world’s worst humanitarian crisis.", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "6a644838d92fe22b76a71e77", "title": "Is MACOM Technology Solutions Holdings (MTSI) Undervalued Following Its Recent Pullback? - Simply Wall Street", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi8gFBVV95cUxPUk1LVlNRU2hyY191aW4xaFpSTUs5U0tKS2ZNdVM5b2p5WEpjUmZIYm5sWFFkd1MwZzRub3lHWFpKN2psS3FfLVZoUWgwVHluSDkwUEZSdjBKTnBYVnY0eFBSalZTSWtORTVuUExqeHVQX2puVDZOYVJuZXFCSUl4YW9SQkotYUYwQlE2X3ZWYi1wemMtemJDU1V5bmg4VzhucDZMbDVST3Z2MWNjWmxFeUU2OWVJM1JwZVJzWFB0XzN", "source": "topic_technology", "published_at": "2026-10-17T09:44:12+00:00", "text": "Is MACOM Technology Solutions Holdings (MTSI) Undervalued Following Its Recent Pullback? - Simply Wall Street\nIs MACOM Technology Solutions Holdings (MTSI) Undervalued Following Its Recent Pullback? Simply Wall Street", "truncated": false}, {"id": "9e4a6cd441694ca07d6ff59b", "title": "Trump Says: \"I Am Hereby Waiving The Application Of Sanctions Provided For In 