e Europe/Radio Liberty", "truncated": false}, {"id": "ed2e8083722c5dc07d449cc5", "title": "11-year old flying car company mocks Tesla Roadster", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/17/11-year-old-flying-car-company-mocks-tesla-roadster?traffic_source=rss", "source": "rss_aljazeera_economy", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:32:42+00:00", "text": "11-year old flying car company mocks Tesla Roadster\n11-year old flying car company mocks Tesla Roadster | Automotive Industry News | Al Jazeera\n11-year old flying car company mocks Tesla Roadster\nCalifornia-based Alef Aeronautics took a playful swipe at Tesla, releasing a video of its flying car soaring over a Tesla Roadster and welcoming the Elon Musk-led automotive giant to the “flying car race”. CEO Jim Dukhovny said Alef had been alone in the race for 11 years.\nShare 11-year old flying car company mocks Tesla Roadster on social media", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "d33994b4edf855564f78033b", "title": "5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar - Dawn", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQVDlrcHpTQW5MS3AwXzZEVVRzRmdYRWxXbDdfcDl5ckk5ajdULXRKeFJZbWREcHJZSXlZa3BWWFZVSl8zNTFjN3dod3pRRzktR2pOUDlTS0ZJMFlFVHktNjdkU3ZHWE95ZnZQOHlxX2IxdlgtSjVvZHZIejFzRnhiMkR0eHhxYU9xOFZ4Rg?oc=5", "source": "lane_cat_weather", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:31:24+00:00", "text": "5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar - Dawn\n5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar Dawn", "truncated": false}, {"id": "27d2145bff69086b39f3047b", "title": "5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar - Dawn", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5qOGdFYXk5dXU1SG9yeW1NZ1l2U1dPX0k2YzZRVzVzdTVOSGxpSXpDLWJPZ25meldVeUxaR3dIRTFKaVh3T0VnbQ?oc=5", "source": "lane_cat_weather", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:31:24+00:00", "text": "5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar - Dawn\n5.9-magnitude earthquake jolts Balochistan's Khuzdar Daw