s of Australian, US surfers in Mexico ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos Mexican judge sentences three men to 158 years in prison for murders of Australian and US surfers​ The Guardian", "truncated": false}, {"id": "18d3ea95d7ef902a10999d0c", "title": "Longsys Shares Plunge Nearly 70% From Peak; Private Placement Investors Sit on 56% Losses Totaling 2.1 Billion Yuan - BigGo Finance", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBIRGZhMG0xU1FDMWltblc2ZlpUMlZZeTdoX19EZE4wa3c4S0RJRVRRYUt2U09LWVFXWXAybl83LVA2SlI3eTZId1BmeXpEUl9odGpud2x1d3psNDZZejBQSDhsN0hkY0FMN05vVE13clFiWlhoRUE?oc=5", "source": "lane_dilution", "published_at": "2026-10-17T05:05:00+00:00", "text": "Longsys Shares Plunge Nearly 70% From Peak; Private Placement Investors Sit on 56% Losses Totaling 2.1 Billion Yuan - BigGo Finance\nLongsys Shares Plunge Nearly 70% From Peak; Private Placement Investors Sit on 56% Losses Totaling 2.1 Billion Yuan BigGo Finance", "truncated": false}, {"id": "e0596f47b1bc7f8181d42fd8", "title": "US Offers Another 17 Million Barrels From Strategic Oil Reserve as Fuel Crisis Deepens - Dainik Jagran MP CG", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOMkk2TlJHenUtcHc1bnF0M0hLWnZqNGFUTFRJZ29BUWc2YlNVb0cydGltZldxUVJiUi1IV1dyNTRvbzd5Uy1QQUNta2FlV2d6bXZHNm9xRU9Tb0s2UktKODJMTXRMcVNYOHBGekhZdF8yLTRtd3l3U2lkZ0xZemxwWVBZRHQtM3NVRWNVYzQ5ZmxUcS1MSmxLTDZROUNxb3luZzQ3X0NXdGhaS2xhQ0tqX1Q1TEFJOXNTTk9DdUtLNm1", "source": "lane_inventory_print", "published_at": "2026-10-17T05:03:36+00:00", "text": "US Offers Another 17 Million Barrels From Strategic Oil Reserve as Fuel Crisis Deepens - Dainik Jagran MP CG\nUS Offers Another 17 Million Barrels From Strategic Oil Reserve as Fuel Crisis Deepens Dainik Jagran MP CG", "truncated": false}, {"id": "51a78a60f456bec82915498c", "title": "AI: Anthropic’s IPO Show and Tell, OpenAI Ads, Meta’s Wonder & More. AI-RTZ #1242 - AI: Reset to Zero", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxObUI1ZGMtZEF