ons under Graham Act - Українська правда\nTrump signs order suspending Russia sanctions under Graham Act Українська правда", "truncated": false}, {"id": "3d495e3f1117857977bc8e63", "title": "Northern Michigan Scores Four to Beat St. Cloud State Men’s Soccer - St. Cloud State University Athletics", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOT3hSanpCTGpBZmVSLVdnQXp3dDBqVHFqd05rcUhsMmc4NzhMNFE0azIxa2F5V21BUlkwWFpDeWhxd25RWHIzNmQxaG5zc1lLQmtFU1dCT2FCMnJ4cHVlSm5FY2xLcFNRUVNmcXZtcHp3QVlEeTlZcmpfbnFwNjBBdC0wVC0wcGk3QlZRblllZmRZOFEwV0NPVkpVMnVKd3AxRWdSMzdLVkc1dVlwMVFocXlJaTFaWjA?oc=5", "source": "topic_technology", "published_at": "2026-10-17T01:35:39+00:00", "text": "Northern Michigan Scores Four to Beat St. Cloud State Men’s Soccer - St. Cloud State University Athletics\nNorthern Michigan Scores Four to Beat St. Cloud State Men’s Soccer St. Cloud State University Athletics", "truncated": false}, {"id": "42d4f65ffc75de664e9dc0ee", "title": "US coastguard rescues 16 after boat sinks off Mexico’s Baja coast", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/17/us-coastguard-rescues-16-after-boat-sinks-off-mexicos-baja-coast?traffic_source=rss", "source": "rss_aljazeera_economy", "published_at": "2026-10-17T01:33:37+00:00", "text": "US coastguard rescues 16 after boat sinks off Mexico’s Baja coast\nShare US coastguard rescues 16 after boat sinks off Mexico’s Baja coast on social media\nThe US coastguard prepares for lift-off in San Diego, California, on October 16, 2026 [Denis Poroy/AP Photo]\nThe US coastguard has said it rescued 16 people from the Pacific Ocean after a boat sank off Mexico’s Baja California coast.\nThe coastguard said on Friday it responded to a Mayday call reporting that a boat was sinking. The search is ongoing for 11 people believed to be still missing.\nTwo deaths reported as Hurricane Simon, storm Rachel batter Mexico’s coast\nMexican court closes case against official over 2023 detention centre fire\nICE tactics spark debate before pivotal US midterm elections\nThe boat went down about 225km (140 miles) west of Ensenada, Mexico.\nA rescue helicopter reached the site about two hours after someone on the boat transmitted the Mayday call at about 1am (08:00 GMT) on Friday, said coastguard Lieutenant Santiago Tamburini.\nIt took about 90 minutes for the coastguard crew, which included a rescue swimmer, to pull the 16 people from the water, Tamburini said.\nThe people rescued were Mexican nationals, according to the Mexican consulate.\nOne survivor was being treated for a suspected shark bite and two were in critical condition, authorities said.\nThe rescued were flown by helicopter to San Diego, California, and transported to hospitals. The Mexican consulate in San Diego said it offered consular assistance.\nThe coastguard and US Navy are continuing to search the area with two helicopters, a fixed-wing plane, a cutter and a navy combat ship.\nThe boat sank in an area frequented by smugglers transporting migrants to the US. It is also popular with fishing and leisure boats.\nDetails about the boat’s origin, destination and what it was doing are not clear. No vessel, only debris, was found, and it was unclear what type of boat was involved, the coastguard said.\n“Boats in that area can be for fishing, leisure, personal recreation. We just don’t know what they were doing out there. We all know it’s a suspected smuggling route,” Tamburini said.", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "b8bba60056db9486e0c35837", "title": "Vanta Holdings closes second tranche of private placement By Investing.com - Investing.com India", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNVW5yX2JmYU9qaVVtSHJOUFBTS3JYbVFlSnRMa1J0OW5lTWFsNWR0VEd2UDIxd1hxY3JBdWJxaDhYOXhNT1ZsRW1xeUtod01HRWcxUEtTcnRLbWNxWVZNSnI1Q3I3TlJ4MXVXeFE3NWNBdkdMUlF5Ul8xNWx1SGdtT1hQa0FRaEhaZThtZWZGQ1RsNTZkcHFCdjFVSjhhejI4TFBJMFZ5ZnBGaGQzMHZqSXVSRmxwMEp2VGc?oc=5", "source": "lane_dilution", "published_at": "2026-10-17T01:33:23+00:00", "tex