ogged their relations since Eritrea gained independence in 1993.\nThey fought a bitter war between 1998 and 2000. And despite a truce, they remained in a state of war for nearly 20 years.\nThe Jeddah accord in 2018 brought peace. But tensions have lingered.\nEthiopia accuses Eritrea of supporting rebels in its Tigray region, while Eritrea accuses landlocked Ethiopia of planning to capture one of its key Red Sea ports.\nCan diplomacy end this deep-rooted conflict?\nFaisal Roble – Political analyst specialising in the Horn of Africa\nJervin Naidoo – Senior political analyst at Oxford Economics Africa\nMatt Bryden – Strategic adviser at Sahan, a think tank focused on governance, politics and security in the Horn of Africa\nShare Can diplomacy resolve longstanding Ethiopia-Eritrea differences? on social media", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "3c2abecd091c62e85dad8021", "title": "RDU launches nonstop Volaris flights to Guadalajara - WNCT", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOUEFKdEFwejJJVUw2R1VuNDhCajh4SkVWRnFRLWMtS1czaTZPWG5GdlQwaFo2eTRZWV9lamhlU1lzQ2c0Q2JoTHBuS2JMTWlBR2N3MllZWmZLdDFKNWNrbi1kTTNHd3FtdTIweXdhN1dzWTF2dy1vNnU3NzE1UjNUZFJYZUjSAYoBQVVfeXFMTU5ubTJnR0JMTng4b3RfSDVBVi1yMXJldWg0WEpLb1dsOU0wMTF4NGJzV1pweVZWZnp", "source": "topic_products", "published_at": "2026-10-16T19:17:36+00:00", "text": "RDU launches nonstop Volaris flights to Guadalajara - WNCT\nRDU launches nonstop Volaris flights to Guadalajara WNCT", "truncated": false}, {"id": "93f1ca16085315075c216f5b", "title": "Form 4 ULTRAPAR HOLDINGS INC For: Oct 14 Filed by: Sa Neto Francisco - StreetInsider", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNRXoxTjZYNkJxeUNLSE5hbHU0elpaUDBWUkRGeXJVLWRMU0pRdU5tZWltbjE4Z0V3cHZvb196M2drTjUyRW9NaG16ZFJHZEpjR1gxNk5qUjNyYXdmb1UzTTVHNEh6U3gyYW5aTzBBSEZ1Y0NidEJ1djZaV2hjWXdQRDNuVmVjRUNNRWZjZmZXOXphQjhFWUpyeTVSNUdRaGVtRUEzRkQwalJDRnlDN20wMWdNZTNGZ0JDcHdoVk9WZGp", "source": "sec_4:google_fallback", "published_at": "2026-10