d the views expressed in Helm’s post “are held by an individual who does not represent the government in any capacity”.\nUK-based activist group Defend Our Juries defended Helm for defying what it called an “absurdly authoritarian ban on Palestine Action”.\n“We know of 36 people who have been arrested and had their homes raided for similarly expressing support for Palestine Action on social media,” said a spokesperson for the group.\n“We hope Sarah will not face the same treatment for standing up for free speech and Palestinian lives.”\nin July 2025, after activists from the group broke into a Royal Air Force base and sprayed red paint on two aircraft to protest against UK military support for Israel’s genocidal war on Gaza. Being a member or a supporter is punishable by up to 14 years in prison.\nmore than 3,500 people in the UK for alleged support of the group, many of them for holding up placards, according to rights group Amnesty International.\nPalestine Action has contested its proscription, but the Court of Appeal\nThe UK’s new Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband last month said the government was “looking at” the Palestine Action ban, adding that he did not believe mass arrests resulting from its proscription were “anyone’s intent”.", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "d20b0cd5cfe8aee43270c6c1", "title": "Tron Inc. Launches $200 Million Stock Sale to Expand TRX Treasury - BigGo Finance", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBYR0ZMYUd5ZHlQcGd1SE1HRjNUbC1zb1R1TjJkbmtLTUZUX085ekRlR0ZSRUVIRnQwVVRDSEVDWm5NTDM1X2cwSER4bTZPZ2J1M3BzbnZxZ2V1ZUNnRmRKc3RHUmR1YkxhM0wxQTRXODI5akd0LWc?oc=5", "source": "topic_government", "published_at": "2026-10-16T18:26:00+00:00", "text": "Tron Inc. Launches $200 Million Stock Sale to Expand TRX Treasury - BigGo Finance\nTron Inc. Launches $200 Million Stock Sale to Expand TRX Treasury BigGo Finance", "truncated": false}, {"id": "f7fa87ebd6465fd4aadfeadd", "title": "Through an employee stock plan, Julio Manso