5cUxQYzlCLUFTSk9LSG95bUdQOUlqcUZWUnozblU4ZzdWUnpfdmc0YjlIRFhRSTNMXzRwaC1vNVNsb1FvNHhWaXFsNXlfQzVzQ0pvMm5oN2ZmODhKcGVaUDNTNjZSWmlIeGI3SVI2dEhvUVBwOFFRaUg1aC10d3pjdWwtWHFkUEI3OHJ0V09CSkRYVXZOcXRWbnNCTw?oc=5", "source": "lane_listing_flow", "published_at": "2026-10-16T16:00:00+00:00", "text": "City Tx raises $200M in IPO to advance siRNA pipeline - BioWorld News\nCity Tx raises $200M in IPO to advance siRNA pipeline BioWorld News", "truncated": false}, {"id": "b9fbebb49a086aa401ffd97b", "title": "We’re sharing 3 tips to study smarter with Gemini Notebook.", "url": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-notebook/three-tips-study-gemini-notebook/", "source": "company_google_blog", "published_at": "2026-10-16T16:00:00+00:00", "text": "We’re sharing 3 tips to study smarter with Gemini Notebook.\nWe’re sharing 3 tips to study smarter with Gemini Notebook.\nStudying for exams can feel overwhelming. To help you prepare, we recently launched three new features in\nto make your learning more structured and engaging.\n: If you’re trying to quickly grasp a tricky concept, you can now generate a 60-second Short Video Overview to help you unpack it. They’re easy to watch on-the-go or share with a classmate.\n: If you have dozens of notes, lectures, and readings to review, you can create an Interactive Learning Overview under Reports to walk you through your material, step by step. It weaves together summaries and studio outputs like slides, quizzes, and flashcards, all grounded strictly in your coursework.\n: We also added more ways for you to test your knowledge with new quiz formats, including short-answer, multi-select, and fill-in-the blank options. After testing yourself or reviewing your flashcards, you can ask your notebook for feedback to pinpoint where you should focus next.\nHow to shape your slides and videos with Gemini Notebook\nSharpen your study routine with new Gemini Notebook tools\nWe’re introducing flexible usage limits for Gemini Notebook.\nExper