20 International in Hyderabad and retired ‌hurt. He was struck while batting as the West Indies levelled the five-match series at 2-2.\nA decision on Arshdeep’s availability for\nin Bengaluru on Saturday will be taken before ⁠the match.\nBhuvneshwar, 36, ⁠returns to India’s T20I setup for the first time in nearly four years.\nThe seamer has also ⁠been named in India’s squad for the T20 International series in ⁠New Zealand, which begins ⁠on October 22.\nfor West Indies captain Shai Hope have evened matters in each of the following games.\nThe second match of the series also marked the West Indies’\nThe hosts claim a 2-1 series win in the One-Day Internationals that preceded the T20s, although Hope’s century in the third match led West Indies to\nShreyas Iyer (c), Abhishek Sharma, Vaibhav Sooryavanshi, Ishan Kishan, Sanju Samson (w), Tilak Varma, ‌Shivam Dube, Kuldeep Yadav, Axar Patel, Ravi Bishnoi, Nitish Kumar Reddy, Arshdeep Singh, Prince ‌Yadav, ‌Mayank Yadav, Naman Dhir, Bhuvneshwar Kumar", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "6866559f05647e606b074466", "title": "Iran says Strait of Hormuz will reopen if U.S. leaves region - Yahoo", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQV0NROGl1TUdDUDZaMjZrLVV6Q0NISHhVT2Z0M1V5OTZpeS1pUkp0Q3l5TjdGaE1WZmVnVGxRMXViZ2xvWHVTN1FFVzI2alp0VUIxY3ZXZEhjb1g1ajZDbFRfTGtaOFhaYmZaaEtUTTMxcmF3eVpSNmMxbUFFSG83UHNzVFhBRG1QRGd2eEhMbmk?oc=5", "source": "topic_geopolitics", "published_at": "2026-10-16T13:09:36+00:00", "text": "Iran says Strait of Hormuz will reopen if U.S. leaves region - Yahoo\nIran says Strait of Hormuz will reopen if U.S. leaves region Yahoo", "truncated": false}, {"id": "0cd8189ef31690c5b029cbd9", "title": "Billionaire Patrick Soon-Shiong wins wider FDA approval for bladder cancer drug - Billionaires.Africa", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNSEdDUUVUSU9PN296clluY1F0NjI3Ykg3Wk8zR19iSVpTX19rQWRDM2ZuRjlfWG4tSFNIOWpjN1VJQWRTckdqNzZQVWtqVGZ5Q2xBTE51cmM1VHM5N0lNa1pHbHplT25