Tesla Slams into Police Vehicle, Seriously Injuring 2 Officers People.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "2c683d49aaa797645a362528", "title": "Six Weeks, Five Companies: Defense and National Security Tech Insiders Are Buying Their Own Shares - TradingView", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi7gFBVV95cUxOemp1TTJuVUkzS3liYnE5ZFhFVnVGWGVmUFJUZW15NnE5ekZwX1hzRzcyNVZnV1U0bFlFdm9ybllMci01b2EtWE9lOGdKRWpqUmhyS09lRW8temJQTmVhQWtpZWlLYXJoRnNscFN0V0t0cXRSWXFBa3BmalpqdUdIZWtSQmJ1ZXpwdnB3SWRTak1MdkFSNGcydTZGeFoydVlnbjNSSFFFMG5KU0tBZHNqQUZJbkg5Mzg3X0NjTGpva3B", "source": "lane_insider_flow", "published_at": "2026-10-16T13:00:00+00:00", "text": "Six Weeks, Five Companies: Defense and National Security Tech Insiders Are Buying Their Own Shares - TradingView\nSix Weeks, Five Companies: Defense and National Security Tech Insiders Are Buying Their Own Shares TradingView", "truncated": false}, {"id": "1327cc4e9aad1b04d089a5c9", "title": "As Tariffs Push Manufacturers to Reshore, Woods Distribution Offers Integrated 3PL Support for U.S. Producers - Newswire.com", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxORU5xLWNYS2ZXV3l1R2F1NHdzVHp6TXBnRG14eTBOa2N5OHBPQ1Q2dDNGRHBHTVJkMFAwVmczVGxZM0JRLVMxbjBVeDlNMHNWLWNIdjVWcjQ0WEw4VlVJOXlBQmgxbWd6dFlpc2RTbFlMXzFqdXdOWWdYakJuMVVUSTFpUnhyR1EzbURnYW4zS243Q3ZkRVlkSHdEcnVJbDYwZmZXRFkxMTNkZDg?oc=5", "source": "topic_geopolitics", "published_at": "2026-10-16T13:00:00+00:00", "text": "As Tariffs Push Manufacturers to Reshore, Woods Distribution Offers Integrated 3PL Support for U.S. Producers - Newswire.com\nAs Tariffs Push Manufacturers to Reshore, Woods Distribution Offers Integrated 3PL Support for U.S. Producers Newswire.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "0f3f8110b0590cdc32c5b2a7", "title": "BNY Targets Blind Spots in ABS After Tricolor Mess Rocked Market - Bloomberg.com", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPS25tcDA4U0R1QzJNclhwaWdoVzlTSG5lMUctcEcwNGhwbmc4dklhd205b1A4ZUVkOWZ5T0F1SmFLQkNGcWFkMmtjMzNzQ