1uUGhnZnhaSGxyT3JlYjVwalJWYmN5bEZGbGx0blZVcG1jSTRmbUtQNjl1c3lxcS1kZHBCdlE?oc=5", "source": "topic_technology", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:38:45+00:00", "text": "Connect Bitbucket Cloud to your AI tools with Atlassian MCP - Atlassian\nConnect Bitbucket Cloud to your AI tools with Atlassian MCP Atlassian", "truncated": false}, {"id": "07e4e7a94bca3e8d704d652f", "title": "UK and EU consider coordination on China tariffs - Semafor", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPQlN6WEE2ZVBfWmZ1dTU5ZWRvMzA5WDAyQWZicWgyTXVVMm4xc3pET2xqbTVDTmpzU1g1azdFWTRVVnh2WF9vaWgwUi1abjlMcml3Rks4YkE5N2VuZGxadHEwdzR6T05tbzdyRTlDc3pnZDdOTWNGZG40czhEWUhUTE5hWFJBMlRiRURTajFPbnBvemM5NVluMHcxcw?oc=5", "source": "topic_geopolitics", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:38:00+00:00", "text": "UK and EU consider coordination on China tariffs - Semafor\nUK and EU consider coordination on China tariffs Semafor", "truncated": false}, {"id": "1f0aba4ed851d370dc93e416", "title": "Dallas Mavericks at a crossroads with Dwight Powell as roster deadline looms - Dallas News", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOYXZvRVZVNXZnZm8xS3R2c0huQi1nUnU4SXdJOVhrbU1Ld045TXBSVlpvUlB1N0xYLUxxMFBlYnVOZ0lIbEhPTzJfemV3dTktTW9QMndIdTRfZ2hRZDFGRzVBV0hrX3dqb2VPc3RzRk4xMktTY0tlcjNBblJvbF9Qam90QUNSQXVVdjJYcERtbGxUNDgzTGZuNURVYk9lbkJPdkt4clpMZmxmZmh4Ync?oc=5", "source": "topic_fed", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:51+00:00", "text": "Dallas Mavericks at a crossroads with Dwight Powell as roster deadline looms - Dallas News\nDallas Mavericks at a crossroads with Dwight Powell as roster deadline looms Dallas News", "truncated": false}, {"id": "52215fea55d1b9dc71b003d0", "title": "Bus hits train stopped on French side of Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6wyrnmgzn01o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "source": "rss_bbc_world", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:21+00:00", "text": "Bus hits train stopped on French side of Channel Tunnel, with 19 injured\nWatch: Emergency crews head towards Channel Tunnel crash\nA bus has hit a stationary freight train near the French entrance to the Channel Tunnel, injuring the driver and 18 passengers, French authorities say.\nThe bus, which was carrying lorry drivers due to take a shuttle rail service, struck the train at the loading platform of the tunnel in Coquelles, near Calais, at 19:27 (18:27 BST) on Thursday.\nThe bus driver and one passenger were severely injured and evacuated by helicopter. None of the injuries were life threatening, a local official said.\nLocal sub-prefect Agathe Cury said freight and Eurostar passenger traffic through the tunnel had not been disrupted after a brief stoppage to evacuate injured people. An investigation has begun.\nTrains near the French entrance to the Channel Tunnel (file image)\n\"Two trains were on either side of the platform. One was being loaded by heavy goods vehicles ahead of a cross-Channel journey, and another train that had previously been loaded was departing,\" Cury said.\n\"For a reason that currently remains unknown, the minibus collided with the departing train.\n\"The bus did not overturn, it is still upright â but the shock and the collision caused injuries to the people involved.\"\nThe incident involved a minibus transporting workers who were about to board Le Shuttle. All were men of different nationalities, she added.\nIt is not clear whether any British nationals are among the injured.\nCury said it was \"the first time an incident of this type has occurred\" on an Eurotunnel loading platform.\nThe BBC's Evan Davis, who was travelling through the Eurotunnel to Calais at the time of the incident, witnessed blue light vehicles \"concentrated on one of the platforms\" as he entered France.\n\"There were plenty of cars queueing up at check-in when I drove past just now, and I saw some cars going through check-in, so despite the collision they weren't being held,\" he said from the scene.\nshowed a small bus with damage to its front and side standing alongside a train, among a crowd of emergency workers.\nEurostar has released an update saying: \"An incident occurred several kilometers away from the Channel Tunnel.\n\"This incident does not involved or impact Eurostar trains running from and to London. All of Eurostar trains will run as expected.\"\nThe Eurotunnel runs under the sea between England and France, from Folkestone in Kent to Coquelles on the French side.\nThree different rail services operate through the tunnel - the Eurostar, a passenger train that begins in London and goes to several European destinations, freight trains which transport goods and Le Shuttle, which transports vehicles.", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "c471991446fc14e11b3dd818", "title": "United States Court of Appeals - United States Courts (.gov)", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi5gFBVV95cUxPanVmVV9uY2ZrdjNSOGxjVFoyb3pEcVJoemVkcnAzZWxFeXhxbmppeDFnSDZ6SnRlV2d4anFzUTItVnRLc29WcEJTWURrVGppcTY1Um9GSUtXSFc5TVhsRkZhaTVwNHhrOHhKSTU3ek90UV9TbndBa1RVWXdEN0NWX3NPX0xiNUtsRVAtOVhxdlpHdmRjU1RIOUpYdmtyaTMtcGpFdkZTbHhrREtOSDF5eHpEQjZVV2IwRng4aXYwYkt", "source": "official_court_search", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:12+00:00", "text": "United States Court of Appeals - United States Courts (.gov)\nUnited States Court of Appeals United States Courts (.gov)", "truncated": false}, {"id": "4f268f56858c49efdcc7de90", "title": "James Madison University launches Centers for Civic Life program - Rocktown Now", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNcTFYenpCNk00NEczdmpGNmJiZVNaVURrSzJENjItN1NKN1ozX3NfWEhJS2VrSVZuMFZlZER4SEJLY3p3bXI1ZWRocmJEdE5vaW9SQTB4TFVZVTllY3VnY2pDeDRRV2dwb3pGeE1US2FNV2lXOVk3bjI1cmtrYkV1WTN6Y3Q2UkhmTDhVWVR4LVBxcDFxQ3BuMmJBZ0d1UFZFTnRN?oc=5", "source": "topic_products", "published_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:05+00:00", "text": "James Madison University launches Centers for Civic Life program - Rocktown Now\nJames Madison University launches Cente