ly\nSign in quickly and securely with passkeys.\nWe're making it easier to identify AI-generated content globally.\nOur latest Linux Foundation Europe donation will build a more private digital world.", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "a4b62a48b655530616da9c4f", "title": "‘It’s heartbreaking’: Award-winning Tullamore chocolatier’s stock destroyed by factory fire - The Irish Times", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNNWRWZnFuWkI1ZXdSV3RZQ3VIMnZFNk94ektSWEpCSTRWek9uM2lDSGdLRFozLTZpNU12Q0JMV3htQUxNT3FMOVhkQmctNUZxTXFOczZZWGhKM2hrcV9uTmg2TXdudDZfVlpHX3d2WEVjX19vemVVWEQwdlh2MEFIMWVsTmdGb3lncF9pc1hQTEdwNVdDSzBrZkFDLXBxR2NDd1FPNVhVNDRubmhVX3VQZjV4NjFSa04tYTdaSWhfM0Y", "source": "lane_blast_ops", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:29:30+00:00", "text": "‘It’s heartbreaking’: Award-winning Tullamore chocolatier’s stock destroyed by factory fire - The Irish Times\n‘It’s heartbreaking’: Award-winning Tullamore chocolatier’s stock destroyed by factory fire The Irish Times", "truncated": false}, {"id": "d79c3bf04f18a5f597c157b0", "title": "Electoral Court decision overturned in favour of ANC - African Christian Democratic Party", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBfUHJWX0xuZ2xaQ2hWQkpLT0FSNXlPZjJtOFVRajVTMWxuSzRNT2tNWWpsUnppS1lFVmxfdnpnakNJMm0yZU03c3doWVV0SGFXNjloMWM2VGdRQVlJclQxWjItSi1wQ05kNEF2UTV1NmpaNkk0X1pfQ3BzZ1pzQQ?oc=5", "source": "lane_blast_legal", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:29:21+00:00", "text": "Electoral Court decision overturned in favour of ANC - African Christian Democratic Party\nElectoral Court decision overturned in favour of ANC African Christian Democratic Party", "truncated": false}, {"id": "234883b455bd30a74e2daf2f", "title": "Images of an Article in the Register of Debates - Congress.gov", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPUEtDdHY4TVRETDBpY0VteW05aVNWTVhIZnozTVVwc3F5SXNQbmhOc1BxbU1nY2k1NWI3b210dUt4Qm5mOUlMOHZ6N3drUG9naDV5aWMtYUdFVko1T3NrM3FES0w0ZFZTdlpEN1I3ZHMwdzdj