OFNNd1hRMVVhSVlRb0dxaVFMeU5USmE3ZmNCSFJOU3NMeGYwWlpFVGxmLWVNa2hhQkgybm9ZempZLWR4cFlxXzhYakFSdnczYThGaEs0eG9EWWZ1d0lLUXVQNzBTaURfS243QjRSY2RVMkNwb09SMFZhWW1HNGlhOXpjYlhXTFVLZzRtV2xvMw?oc=5", "source": "sec_8-K:google_fallback", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:00:28+00:00", "text": "A November 4 payout is set as Star Group (SGU) declares its quarterly distribution. - Stock Titan\nA November 4 payout is set as Star Group (SGU) declares its quarterly distribution. Stock Titan", "truncated": false}, {"id": "46e7cecee360222aa2134f6b", "title": "Be There for the Beginning: Celebrate the Launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark", "url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/local-ai-rtx-spark-launch-event-invite/", "source": "company_nvidia_blog", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:00:23+00:00", "text": "Be There for the Beginning: Celebrate the Launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark\nA new beginning for Windows PCs starts tomorrow with the launch of\n— one PC built for creators, gamers and AI agents. All are invited to celebrate with NVIDIA and partners at launch events around the world.\nEvery PC has a story. What was your first Windows PC, and what did it spark a love for? Join the celebration online by sharing responses with\nfor a chance to win an ASUS ProArt P14 RTX Spark laptop signed by NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang.\nFrom local AI workflows to creative apps and gaming, see what reviewers are saying about RTX Spark — then experience it at a launch celebration.\n“The fact that NVIDIA, Microsoft and their partners have delivered such a capable, compatible and polished platform even in its first at-bat should put the rest of the PC industry on notice.” —\n“I tested NVIDIA’s RTX Spark for gaming and local AI – the performance absolutely stunned me.” —\n“I’m very happy to report that performance is actually looking really good when it comes to AI, gaming and creative workflows.” —\n“[RTX Spark] is a different species of computer that has arrived early. It is a statement of intent from NVIDIA about where computing is going — trading raw benchmarking crowns for the ability to carry a self-rewriting, fully autonomous, CUDA-accelerated digital brain in your backpack.” —\n“One of the most impressive parts of the launch is how many apps NVIDIA has worked with to ensure optimisation with the Spark technology.” —\nIndependent testing from Artificial Analysis offers an early look at the powerful local AI performance RTX Spark brings to a laptop.\nOn Friday, Oct. 16, get hands on with RTX Spark at launch events around the world. Explore demos for creating, developing and gaming, connect with fellow enthusiasts and discover what local AI can do.\nTimes below are local. Follow each event’s entry instructions. Space is limited.\nBest Buy, 1717 Harrison Street, 10 a.m.-12 p.m\n. Try hands-on demos, meet iJustine and hear fireside conversations with local tech founders. Free, first-come, first-served entry; no ticket required.\nXperion at Saturn, Alexanderplatz 3, 7-10:30 p.m\n. Explore hands-on demos and stage programming with creators and developers. Registration required.\n. Join an evening of demos, music and AI community discussions, with shopping and networking continuing until 10:15 p.m.\nJD MALL Beijing Shuangjing Store, No. 31 Guangqu Road\n. Check in begins at 7 p.m. Launch celebration starts at 8 p.m., followed by hands-on demos. Event concludes at 9:30 p.m. Register through WeChat.\nVatan Bilgisayar Topkapı, Mevlana Caddesi No. 138\n. Explore hands-on demos and local creator programming. Walk-in entry; no advance registration required.\n. Hands-on demos begin at 7 p.m., with gaming and AI creator programming from 8 p.m. Event concludes at 9:30 p.m. No advance registration required.\nRTX Spark Ignites Global Celebration as New Windows PCs Arrive\nBe There for the Beginning: Celebrate the Launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark\nOpen From Data Center to Desktop: NVIDIA Expands Nemotron Family With Highest Efficiency Super VL and Bolt Models\nThe Nordics and NVIDIA Show What’s Possible When a Region Commits to Advanced Computing", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "f182434762d35d0e3ffe9b9c", "title": "Attorney General Jennings joins coalition seeking protections in Character.AI bankruptcy case - CoastTV", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggJBVV95cUxORVVRUG40dDhIcGpSeTQxNGZjYmZuVzUzLUEwWGdScklNT252X2lLaGticmI2S3hzcGRRZ1FwOWlSaFhuRG1aMHpuMmctWFZRbVJPMS1BdUY0VnVMdVBFMVdjX3ctM19HSVh3RjVJWlo1RkFtcnFDU25EN1QtY2V5R3lhYW5vNGJwNFZCWGZWTTZLTkE2d2FJV24tOGQ1akFVTjNwQ3B4TGEzZ2F1U0RYbHpabmhuV3JpTkNXZ1FSYjN", "source": "lane_distress_restruct", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:00:00+00:00", "text": "Attorney General Jennings joins coalition seeking protections in Character.AI bankruptcy case - CoastTV\nAttorney General Jennings joins coalition seeking protections in Character.AI bankruptcy case CoastTV", "truncated": false}, {"id": "3e8849836c291aa9d25f2852", "title": "Supreme Court restores dismissal of partition suit, holds unsubstantiated allegations cannot defeat sale - The Times of India", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogJBVV95cUxOU0lZdFdVeGlnSHg1RlFkYzc3MXVHV1ItVTlaMVd3SGdtWnUyM2poUUh6eXJ5d1l3UkZOR1c3NS1HSXl3UXd1c2Jzd2tHbkV2TXEwdHlPSm85Rzc3Q0MybU9COEdiTHhXNEJzRmxNUkJTMVZ6THl1SDZadTlUdm5veXJ1OUl5Y3A4NDFKNlZfSm9lNXB0cktKcVNBcEJUSTE5a1pMVXV3czdBakxnUHpZYkZ4U0dickg0eVZBR2xjZUl", "source": "lane_blast_legal", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:00:00+00:00", "text": "Supreme Court restores dismissal of partition suit, holds unsubstantiated allegations cannot defeat sale - The Times of India\nSupreme Court restores dismissal of partition suit, holds unsubstantiated allegations cannot defeat sale The Times of India", "truncated": false}, {"id": "3590b1a4d4beb4418977a952", "title": "AI Maverick Intel, Inc. (AIMV) Signs Definitive Deal to Acquire Heal Access - TradingView", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQZkZtZ3RoRlg2cHFKZkd3OW1VYnp0MTI2UTAxMS1MQTZrVk5wRGtVTklGZl9UMHprMGdHR0ZVRTRnR3d3cEhObXZ