d stance – TD Securities - FXStreet", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPcXNsWEI3Y0I0dms0UWM2ZnhCLWhfMVBsaU43WEdJblZLODRIM3hqODVaal9CaEo5R0ZyZ3VUWVlYbHdPU0VhVU5XNVNIeGY5RjExdGM4TExlNU5zdWdtbEMzN3lRWXBZZDhCaEFKc0t5Y0JlZTk0MU9MR1JkU1RDRmFFamMwemM1TlFjeG1jcnpMU2FHMnI0TXM2ZklaVUttVkZrdjNaMDZqV1Iw?oc=5", "source": "lane_print_vs_priced", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:52:41+00:00", "text": "United States: PCE Inflation forecast and Fed stance – TD Securities - FXStreet\nUnited States: PCE Inflation forecast and Fed stance – TD Securities FXStreet", "truncated": false}, {"id": "090630e690821ffac72705ae", "title": "CHMP Recommends Approval of Daraxonrasib for Previously Treated Metastatic Pancreatic Cancer - OncLive", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNUTZwbHNPWVh2Rk0xTFpDcnV0WlYwTG5uaHU5ZlBzWGhSSm85dGJjRFlMQ3lXcVhyQ2QyNHVnUUpERGFfbVV5UXl0ajQyOWFXR1dLNUgyNFpJWlB5T09nc3FGYWV2RU5zZmhwWGtxZ3N3VGtxZ2xxZUxwLWRsOFE2bEd5dTdCNnFHd19Wd0l2eFQ4VnRueXNuTXpVcHNTZzVMc1FwR2hoSXlJRFJnbUstSTNQY2JwY1FlMTljRmdn?oc", "source": "lane_gate", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:51:52+00:00", "text": "CHMP Recommends Approval of Daraxonrasib for Previously Treated Metastatic Pancreatic Cancer - OncLive\nCHMP Recommends Approval of Daraxonrasib for Previously Treated Metastatic Pancreatic Cancer OncLive", "truncated": false}, {"id": "5cd3d99956ee39d8d637a3e8", "title": "Seven crew missing after drone attack leaves tanker ablaze off Romania's coast", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60qkgpp592yo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "source": "rss_bbc_world", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:51:30+00:00", "text": "Seven crew missing after drone attack leaves tanker ablaze off Romania's coast\nA search and rescue operation involving boats and helicopters is now continuing in rough seas, Romania's authorities say\nSeven of 12 crew members are missing after a drone attack left a chemical tanker ablaze off Romania's coast on Thursday morning, naval authorities say.\nThe San Marino-flagged Wine Trader was 13 nautical miles (24km) east of the mouth of the River Danube at Sulina, when it reported blasts and a fire.\nRomanian President NicuÈor Dan confirmed that the Wine Trader and another chemical tanker in the area, the Yara J, had both been struck by drones - the Yara J on Wednesday.\nThe Wine Trader was empty of cargo at the time.\nMoscow said two cargo ships with military cargo heading to Ukraine's Odesa port had been hit. It did not name the vessels.\nOvernight, a swarm of Russian drones was detected not far from the scene, near Ukraine's Snake Island.\nThe west coast of the Black Sea has recently seen a spate of drone attacks.\nOn Tuesday, two merchant ships were struck by drones further south along the coast of Bulgaria, Romania's neighbour, and one of the vessels sank, leaving 11 crew members missing.\nBulgaria said it suspected Russia was behind that attack, summoning the country's envoy.\nA search and rescue operation for the missing members of the Wine Trader continues, Romania's authorities have said. Two Black Hawk helicopters and two rescue boats have been deployed.\nThe Romanian interior ministry has released a video showing one of the helicopters hovering above the vessel.\nThe priority is now to reach the four crew members confirmed to be alive, while ensuring the safety of rescue teams with very high waves reported in the area.\nThe Wine Trader tanker, which was sailing from Tunisia to Romania, reported several explosions on board at about 07:00 (05:00 GMT).\nRomanian media cited crews on nearby ships as saying the Wine Trader had been hit by two drones.\nThe leaders of Romania and Bulgaria are due to discuss shortly whether Article 4 of the Nato treaty should be invoked.\nThis allows any member of the military alliance to request consultations with its allies if it believes its territorial integrity or security is threatened.\nThe Romanian president said: \"We want to have all the information about what happened, but there will be a response from the Romanian state.\"\nDan is due to meet Nato Secretary General Mark Rutte in Brussels alongside Bulgarian Prime Minister Rumen Radev to discuss growing security threats in the Black Sea region.\nThe Romanian president said discussions would focus on operational requirements, including additional equipment to protect shipping in the area.\nUkraine has directly blamed Russia for earlier attacks on civilian vessels in the western side of the Black Sea - a key route for Ukrainian exports and imports.\nOn Tuesday, European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen spoke of the Black Sea becoming \"another front of escalation of the Russian war in Ukraine. This is unacceptable\".\nRussia's military has recently intensified its strikes on vessels in the area, as part of its war against Ukraine.\nA fire broke out on the Comoros-flagged Yara J late on Wednesday after being struck by a drone, but its crew - who are all reportedly safe - were able to douse the flames themselves.\nLast week, another two ships were struck off Bulgaria, and on the same day Ukraine hit an oil tanker in the Russian Black Sea port of Sochi.\nMoscow says it is targeting ships delivering weapons and dual-use cargo to Ukrainian ports.\nKyiv and its European allies say merchant vessels carrying grain and other civilian cargo are being attacked.\nBoth Russia and Ukraine are major grain-exporting countries and Turkey has called on both countries to halt attacks in the Black Sea.\nMoscow has repeatedly rejected calls by the US and Europe for a naval ceasefire in the Black Sea, blaming Ukraine for attacking Russian merchant ships in the area.\nRussian President Vladimir Putin launched a full-scale invasion of Ukraine in 2022, and Moscow currently controls about 20% of Ukrainian territory", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "bff233da1d2cb763f9a93124", "title": "National Fuel to spin off Appalachian upstream, gathering business - https://megaproject.com/", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOckFxbUhHLXR0MlBIbjhfeEQtYWl0anFBQ2NabHBvR2V6MGRIekVXa2xsS19Ba2xBcExMOWMwd1VYbHpROHVvODBHbHhOaGt1SEpDV241Sjg1WG5wVTQ4MGRoR29ocDg0dzJFeGVHMTh0V000RkpfN3pMVGNCWjV2RGpzd1hMY1VCeF9iOXdKQmtwR28zQlJDLUdadm50N0VxNGJFMC1RUQ?oc=5", "source": "lane_corporate_action_spinoff", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:51:09+00:00", "text": "National Fuel to spin off Appalachian upstream, gathering business - https://megaproject.com/\nNational Fuel to spin off Appalachian upstream, gathering business https://megaproject.com/", "truncated": false}, {"id": "3cb3dd9d336763a0353101f9", "title": "De la Espriella seeks to withdraw peace deal focus on rural reform from UN oversight - Justice For Colombia", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQRk4tYmk3S0I1SWgtWXU1c1huRWVVLXNYdVpHUTFJSThOVkRrSmFfNjRvUUo4Nk9Qd3dkdGVqSmVkdVJDSVh3NHQxSFdJVVVWdTNVWkJhdV9FV01talM5MjVhNFo1Vnl0ZXVNc29sRWhyOVRaSmRVMDJkM2J5WTQ5NWwzbVZObU4ycUExN2lXRUZNYWZtNXlfQ0xUbWlLMkpuZTlFVHlIWVcyQU53T0tKa2Jtel9CLTdCRmZEbU5oNW9", "source": "lane_regime_break", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:50:49+00:00", "text": "De la Espriella seeks to withdraw peace deal focus on rural reform from UN oversight - Justice For Colombia\nDe la Espriella seeks to withdraw peace deal focus on rural reform from UN oversight Justice For Colombia", "truncated": false}, {"id": "035fe6ea5ca2d60c1807bf9e", "title": "Bill Mann on AI Investing, Market Volatility and Global Stock Opportunities - Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPOE1ZaFRqc0ZBVXg3MVhocVZjMlExcjZiMVRRdkhXdWJiWWZweGNjSXBLSW1scnFZOHFVaFV5S25vWTNWSG1TUlRzbVhnLWhZQmhoR0dpM2k4OTdobGtETTc4c3d2VDY2RGVnLTJsd3c1cHotU01EaGFfQW8tbW1OblhB?oc=5", "source": "lane_regime_state", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:50:48+00:00", "text": "Bill Mann on AI Investing, Market Volatility and Global Stock Opportunities - Yahoo Finance\nBill Mann on AI Investing, Market Volatility and Global Stock Opportunities Yahoo Finance", "truncated": false}, {"id": "6aacbb6dec48666bdda6041d", "title": "Bangladesh delegation's walkout during Israeli President’s speech - Views Bangladesh", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxORnFkT013OVU3RlJTQ3A5NExhWUJoU1gtbkhENUJTNlREaXhvRFV0bFdYWkgzd0ZzdEIxZnA4UzV1VXlSWjlyZnE5dXJsYldNUXZpNGJhN2Z1Q21VWkpBLVhXT2tIX0xuUzBlaHZNLURjOVd5a1B0NGdfRkFpZHllNy1zeHJjd2E4RXR2QXQ1QWRrWWRyTzNR?oc=5", "source": "lane_labor_stop", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:50:06+00:00", "text": "Bangladesh delegation's walkout during Israeli President’s speech - Views Bangladesh\nBangladesh delegation's walkout during Israeli President’s speech Views Bangladesh", "truncated": false}, {"id": "42260031e3584326afc7a344", "title": "Trane Technologies Falls as Macro Pressure and Recent Insider Selling Weigh on Shares - Moomoo", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQQU96M1Z6MmpKZHVtalpUMnhhSzN3SmJybHRBaGtjZng0REowTUNfbHp4VjBReS0tZHNNYWo3RjFHazU5ZFIxYUN2bm0wQXF1UGdiSnZ2b25IVVJETDNNSHd5VW52RWR2cFJWQ1VTSFNHeTZmRTI4YWl5b0xLVUhpcE83NkVva1lBTTdkWHZUdFV0Ml9KQWRjd0VNOXQ3TjlYRTl2ZnlLek1Ka3phNUlhcEZPbw?oc=5", "source": "lane_insider_flow", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:50:04+00:00", "text": "Trane Technologies Falls as Macro Pressure and Recent Insider Selling Weigh on Shares - Moomoo\nTrane Technologies Falls as Macro Pressure and Recent Insider Selling Weigh on Shares Moomoo", "truncated": false}, {"id": "4f9234eb2a10a30610b5ac24", "title": "Trane Technologies Falls as Macro Pressure and Recent Insider Selling Weigh on Shares - Quiver Quantitative", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQOUhQd1dLRjVSRjdXbDU3OHVReTJNM3IyUXdJYkdYTHhQaDN1Zld5Q2VGUmZpcmJNbzNjeTJFeHFNWEExWlNwSUM5ZVhEczJxNTU3cnAyb3RfOGhrdUpEU1RyXzlwX0pvcDk1ZDUySXl5eTY2Y2VJMFNIWW5JT1BxeG14VWg0TkZ3WEdZa1RhUW1wS245ZFRyVm9LTzA4MEhHb3U5akR2U1dQVkprOGF3ajVEVGlvUVZoWUE?oc=5", "source": "lane_insider_flow", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:50:00+00:00",