afety of Serbia’s election - AP News", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOem9GMGJJNHBUYmZUZVdRQ2FsU0VZU29LTnVIbUNXa1gtX04wZGJkd3FyV1NYNDJmTkZQTzhBUmtjYW9hbGRNVjZ0N1hWQzk3cDA0MXFrR3N4a3lGNlFEekdpdXBIY3N4N3dDVnJLS2o1WmRFcWNWOUdXSXdjdGFmQzRqd0tING92bHkySVBOREgwUFhqZUFsdw?oc=5", "source": "rss_ap_business:google_fallback", "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:02:00+00:00", "text": "International monitors raise concerns over fairness and safety of Serbia’s election - AP News\nInternational monitors raise concerns over fairness and safety of Serbia’s election AP News", "truncated": false}, {"id": "30a2d475117c345d80266551", "title": "Intuit to acquire revenue management tech start-up Sequence - FinTech Futures", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE1NU0c2akkwTTFFNTVXMzVpUW5RbEQwVEdjaDM3dVhITzlMNkdWT2IyblloaS04YlFiMjRIYTdVT0dTRTR3UEtQeWcwVlp4S1pzYkZJUDFZbEJRc2dQRllyblg5MjlRZmd6SjBweC13?oc=5", "source": "lane_corporate_action_mna", "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:01:28+00:00", "text": "Intuit to acquire revenue management tech start-up Sequence - FinTech Futures\nIntuit to acquire revenue management tech start-up Sequence FinTech Futures", "truncated": false}, {"id": "ee730cc7b3b1fbe60dd594bc", "title": "Wholesale Inflation Hit Four-Year High in September - WSJ", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOMGx6WHoyVnctUFBLRl8tcUs1THlPWTNKMThjQU9WcDJObmV1S1E0eVV6dUZYR1hpX1E3WUFWellJMDhBdDE0RTk2cDZGeElaR0RfRUtWZktYWDZKU0VEWTFHQmY4TUhsR0hQdzh5c241dTZhUXNHQWQ3LURPVGxZeVNicjBfeHBkQVhHSl9WaEVsb3ExM0lRQlNQNFVJZEQ4Skw4?oc=5", "source": "lane_factor_impulse", "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:01:00+00:00", "text": "Wholesale Inflation Hit Four-Year High in September - WSJ\nWholesale Inflation Hit Four-Year High in September WSJ", "truncated": false}, {"id": "efd79f8f5d3d6f6bc420504a", "title": "Dial Up the Cloud: NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 Controls Arrive on GeForce NOW", "url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-enshrouded-update/", "source": "company_nvidia_blog", "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:00:59+00:00", "text": "Dial Up the Cloud: NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 Controls Arrive on GeForce NOW\nDial in the next gaming session this GFN Thursday. New NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 controls give\nmore choice over how supported games look and perform in the cloud, even without the latest hardware.\nThen, step into the Shroud as Keen Games’\nleaves early access with its 1.0 release, or let the bolts fly in\n. Both are streaming on GeForce NOW at launch.\nWith 10 new games joining the cloud this week, members can put the new controls to work in supported titles and keep playing across\nwithout downloads, installs or expensive hardware upgrades.\nFine-Tune the Cloud With DLSS 4.5 Controls\ncontrols are now available on GeForce NOW, giving members more choice over how supported games look and perform in the cloud, even without the latest hardware. DLSS Super Resolution sharpens image quality, while Dynamic Multi Frame Generation delivers lower latency and reduces stutter for smoother streaming, and Ray Reconstruction enhances ray-traced visuals. In addition, Ultimate members streaming on GeForce RTX 5080-powered cloud rigs benefit from the maximum available options, including Dynamic Multi Frame Generation up to 4X.\nFrom James Bond’s globe-trotting missions in\n’s reality-bending Manhattan and the shadowy scares of\n, the controls help fine-tune supported games for image quality, responsiveness or a preferred balance between the two.\nThese new settings are available in the GeForce NOW app under settings, for Windows, macOS, Chrome OS and Steam OS platforms. Members can read\nfor more details on using the feature with their membership tier, and more information on how to get the smoothest cloud game streaming for some games on GeForce NOW.\n1.0 brings the co-op survival action role-playing game out of early access and into its full release. Rise as a Flameborn, the last ember of hope of a dying race, and venture into a vast world of survival, action and role-playing, where a corrupting fog has consumed a once-beautiful kingdom.\nto existing systems, alongside expansions\nwith nine new spells, new mage and archer skills, reworked wands and upgradeable Eternal spells and arrows. New enemy variants keep encounters fresh, while a new biome raises the player level cap to 50 and equipment cap to 55.\n1.0 ready to play in the cloud at launch across supported devices. Skip the 60GB local install to save precious storage space, then step into the Shroud without waiting for downloads or needing to make room for the update.\nis now streaming on GeForce NOW. The brutal, fast-paced sequel to the retro first-person shooter brings more enemies, more weapons and new ways to purge.\nPicking up directly after the original game, a branching single-player campaign sends the fight to grimdark new worlds.\nChoose between the formidable Sternguard Veteran Malum Caedo and the swift Sister of Battle Nyra Veyrath, each with distinct abilities, weapons and play styles. From towering hive cities to jungle mangrove swamps, new enemy types await in every biome.\nGeForce NOW keeps the campaign ready in the cloud. No local rig upgrades or game installs stand between members and the fight — the Emperor’s work waits for no loading bar.\nIn addition, members can look for the following joining the\nAlso this week, the performance of DLSS 5’s 3D-Guided Neural Rendering model is improving by 2X, enabling even more gamers to enjoy DLSS 5’s transformative uplift in lighting and materials at high frame rates and settings. The new, more performant\non Oct. 16 on GeForce NOW, GeForce RTX 50 Series GPUs and RTX Spark laptops.\nDates listed above reflect when games are released on their respective stores. GeForce NOW availability may vary, as games are onboarded after they’re released and added throughout the week. Keep an eye on GeForce NOW channels and GFN Thursdays for availability updates to announced titles.\nGamers who want to test out the new 4.5 controls and high-performance GeForce NOW cloud gaming can start with a\nto try premium cloud gaming before committing to a membership. Better yet, the cost of the day pass can be applied toward a first monthly membership — making it easy to try GeForce RTX-powered cloud gaming with the latest releases, then level up for more.\nWhat’s on the playlist this weekend? Let us know on\nRTX Spark Ignites Global Celebration as New Windows PCs Arrive\nBe There for the Beginning: Celebrate the Launch of NVIDIA RTX Spark\nOpen From Data Center to Desktop: NVIDIA Expands Nemotron Family With Highest Efficiency Super VL and Bolt Models\nThe Nordics and NVIDIA Show What’s Possible When a Region Commits to Advanced Computing", "truncated": false, "full_text": true}, {"id": "368ecf5ded36ac9463c4683a", "title": "A $1 Trillion Chip Rout Draws Billions Into Leveraged ETF Bets - Bloomberg.com", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQSElBdWpJbkdBU3VDWmVwS3RlWVUydlF5a01qdVM0MmpuYkRCUTQwZTRGUE5Dc2s4UFNGSkVFbGJ1RmtVS200NjRKUEFvZEVBdUV0M0R4NFVYQUEwaDFlUGluRXBBVTVOT2p1V3NLbGthN3NrTzBwRHlNV2lLWWNhNEVyR2lrakVac3I0cjZnbDlpYnctd01EVHppTmxXckhmdU9HQ3hVelZ2SE1QaHVYOGFn?oc=5", "source": "publisher_bloomberg", "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:00:49+00:00", "text": "A $1 Trillion Chip Rout Draws Billions Into Leveraged ETF Bets - Bloomberg.com\nA $1 Trillion Chip Rout Draws Billions Into Leveraged ETF Bets Bloomberg.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "5d56ea541968156b34d7fef5", "title": "An investor reports over 5% of MaxCyte (MXCT) after October 14 share purchases. - Stock Titan", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQVkwyZUtGN01OSWl1NjFwRm41ZnVjdXppOXI2T3d1VHNHUDcybkVteHpUTHJYZTlVckN2WHQ3cjVGaHphWVM2ckVDR1ZQbk00WFRLTXl5eHNneDFrR1FaRjlqMFZ0NkdTWk8yN0Z1ME9YLUcyTU8ybWxzZXcyOVliaFN5dm5lNUs1UVdJQ0tQOEdvWFNNS21rbVVXVXowYk5QbkpNbWhqMkNDbEpoV1k4NWJpUWJQZ0NXMVE?oc=5", "source": "sec_SC_13D:google_fallback", "published_at": "2026-10