.com\nWatch Porsche CEO With a First Look at Mission S Sports Car Bloomberg.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "abf8a48b2c4ad0a37de8fa7c", "title": "Watch Anthropic Urged to Pause IPO for AI Safety by NYC Comptroller - Bloomberg.com", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQbFc1THBQWC1yVmw5NTlwdktxaXA4b0pyRmo5cWRHQ0JhOWNsYnhBdEpOVjFxai1VeTZUcnBuNkM0RmZiX09OOFNjSDZpN0QwRHZYSVc3dE95NkRUQWFuV1ozVm5qYUhQOHo3Nmd1Rk9TX2hVTmE4aTdLejhWMHJSaFE5X0NHNFRGNzBxY1pGbTFSSk1rLUVEWXFBN2RKMzJBamVMTw?oc=5", "source": "lane_listing_flow", "published_at": "2026-10-15T00:00:00+00:00", "text": "Watch Anthropic Urged to Pause IPO for AI Safety by NYC Comptroller - Bloomberg.com\nWatch Anthropic Urged to Pause IPO for AI Safety by NYC Comptroller Bloomberg.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "a700d683a4f28c3d9153bc32", "title": "Bina Puri doubles down on Sarawak pivot as it emerges from debt restructuring - The Edge Malaysia", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE4yNjZuaS1LQXdnN1ltZnV0azJWemtuU3BWVlhidzJnNnFEaDFlU1IyenhtdTBOTUxtWVdfNC1MUVhrWEdHVjhoSlVEWVY1MTAx?oc=5", "source": "lane_distress_restruct", "published_at": "2026-10-15T00:00:00+00:00", "text": "Bina Puri doubles down on Sarawak pivot as it emerges from debt restructuring - The Edge Malaysia\nBina Puri doubles down on Sarawak pivot as it emerges from debt restructuring The Edge Malaysia", "truncated": false}, {"id": "94eadcab22c41e356a1d9bf1", "title": "Sullivan & Cromwell brings legal expertise into agreement review", "url": "https://openai.com/index/sullivan-cromwell", "source": "company_openai_blog", "published_at": "2026-10-15T00:00:00+00:00", "text": "Sullivan & Cromwell brings legal expertise into agreement review\nOctober 15, 2026 Sullivan & Cromwell brings legal expertise into agreement review In collaboration with OpenAI, Sullivan & Cromwell developed Agreement Analyzer, an AI tool for identifying issues in a draft agreement. Contact sales Company size: Enterprise Region: North America Industry: Services Products: ChatGPT Loading… Share For lawyers at Sullivan & Cromwell, reviewing a draft agreement includes weighing its terms against relevant precedents, using approaches based on the Firm’s experience and being mindful of a client’s priorities. The firm’s Agreement Analyzer brings those inputs into a single review workflow, producing analysis and proposed changes that lawyers can inspect and refine. “I think AI will . . . allow lawyers to focus on the areas where their judgment is most important . . . so they can concentrate on the questions that are most critical for their clients.” —John Savva, Partner, Sullivan & Cromwell Bringing firm expertise into agreement review Though AI was initially used most for repetitive, administrative tasks like drafting email responses or checking calendars, Savva finds that recent improvements in AI models’ analytical capabilities have changed its usage. “Now, we’re seeing many more opportunities for use in challenging legal tasks such as deep analysis of complex agreements,” he says. Agreement Analyzer helps lawyers compare corresponding provisions across precedents and track how those provisions interact. Sullivan & Cromwell partner John Savva developed Agreement Analyzer as a single-user proof of concept built with Codex. He then collaborated with OpenAI on improving the quality of outputs, enhancing efficiency through parallel processing and transforming the application into a tool that could be used by multiple lawyers at the same time. Agreement Analyzer integrates Sullivan & Cromwell’s workflows, curated firm precedents, negotiating playbooks and ChatGPT Enterprise. After inputting a draft agreement into the tool, a lawyer can add their own selected precedents and a playbook with firm and client positions, as well as information on market practice. The tool performs multiple review cycles from different perspectives, synthesizes the outputs, helps identify potential issues and returns a memorandum and proposed tracked changes for a lawyer to review, adapt or reject. “It’s not about replacing lawyers. It’s about providing a tool for lawyers to do deeper analyses and find more authority and precedents to provide an even higher quality product for their clients.” —John Savva, Partner, Sullivan & Cromwell Making sources and uncertainty visible Savva emphasizes that what makes an AI tool’s output trustworthy is full transparency. “If an AI tool makes a claim about market practice, you need to be able to see the source of that information,” he says. Savva describes an application in which agents develop conclusions and other agents challenge them in an a", "truncated": true}, {"id": "8658445a28afecddd913cc71", "title": "Watch Ross Gerber on Tesla Roadster, Potential SpaceX Merger - Bloomberg.com", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNclJrZjRsV1hwMDJ0S2kxWTU1S3kxcllNV0cycHNnYnUwUmVVZ1pOaDJBMHpvc2VySDlZRTNndVVwVExRdlZsS2ZxWExzMjJQVU5xakZ3YUhRRWRlOTQwRnowb2R3VnhMZkdOUkZycG5xQWphRzBkVmFCemQ2TEFnMmZtaW00TWFwRVByRl9uMjFucUE4c2hOcjJUNDV5c1lKaW5KMjBZN3NjNmIz?oc=5", "source": "publisher_bloomberg", "published_at": "2026-10-15T00:00:00+00:00", "text": "Watch Ross Gerber on Tesla Roadster, Potential SpaceX Merger - Bloomberg.com\nWatch Ross Gerber on Tesla Roadster, Potential SpaceX Merger Bloomberg.com", "truncated": false}, {"id": "6ee751d677da9447fff7555b", "title": "Research Roundtable on the Development of Transcranial Ultrasound - U.S. Food and Drug Administration (.gov)", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_gFBVV95cUxNb3g0cFRNeDdYTVFoWTBTN3RoUEYzWDc3eGxLUFd3UHZXRDhVVmNDQ1JxUFY4OUpIN0EwVzRTT0o4RGJ2bmFUZmozMGRJRDg0Q2JwRmhXLXhuY3JOc015dFZPNHVxWWlyTEU0MXh0MlNBMllLb2x4enBsOVpYUUE2ZDFvMEk1LVE2R0lrNU9vd3g4ZmhuSkI5aW05aDlwS2RZZlMzcWtHaHpFOHdaZE1MOWpWRTJjamtQbi1FN0dkc1Z", "source": "official_fda_search", "published_at": "2026-10-15T00:00:00+00:00", "text": "Research Roundtable on the Development of Transcranial Ultrasound - U.S. Food and Drug A